comments[7]:
  - created_at: "2026-09-13T16:15:21.639Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Continuation observation: runtime-contracts.ts still contains generic interface/member filler despite coverage gates. The command-discovery tranche improves the modified module and function documentation with concrete visibility and assembly semantics, but does not implement the repository-wide filler census or ratchet owned here. Reuse this canonical owner for that remaining work; no duplicate item created."
    edited_at: "2026-09-13T16:45:43.487Z"
  - created_at: "2026-09-20T15:05:48.688Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "PR 1281 review reports 60 percent docstring coverage for touched functions, while repository gates enforce a different public-API denominator. Reusing this canonical open documentation-quality owner after all-status duplicate and ownership checks. This pass documents private helpers and replaces generic package-export descriptions in the three touched modules; the repository-wide filler census and ratchet remain open here. No runtime behavior or coverage thresholds will change."
  - created_at: "2026-09-20T15:08:14.465Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Review evidence: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1281#issuecomment-5750542236 identifies missing touched-function docstrings. Added semantic documentation for all 49 named callables across the three implementation modules and replaced generic guide-shell export descriptions. TypeScript AST printing with comments removed proves all three executable syntax trees are identical to the prior fully covered head. The scope-splitting suggestion is declined because the requested delivery intentionally combines the three PM workstreams; the PR description now explains that scope."
  - created_at: "2026-09-20T15:13:26.783Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Documentation-only verification passed: linked build, repository ESLint and repository-static-quality assurance. Named-callable AST census is 49/49 across the three touched modules, and comment-stripped syntax trees are unchanged from the 9150-test, exact-four-metric-100-percent implementation head. The broader repository filler census and ratchet remain unfinished; releasing this owner back to open after the scoped improvements."
  - created_at: "2026-09-22T13:40:48.353Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "AST census found 4192 filler comments in 210 files. Ten Commander contract comments now describe alias precedence, value presence, and accumulation semantics; remaining baseline is 4182 in 209 files. Exact per-file counts and PR-base comparisons prohibit growth and stale ceilings. Broader replacement debt remains explicit rather than being presented as zero."
  - created_at: "2026-09-22T13:49:09.610Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Latest pm-changelog 2026.9.18 installed through the package lifecycle; generated changelog check is unchanged before item closeout. Documentation content enforcement now complements existing 100 percent docstring coverage; replacement debt is explicitly 4182 remaining comments, not a claim of complete semantic documentation."
  - created_at: "2026-09-22T14:23:31.474Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Completed this delivery's census, no-growth ratchet, touched-declaration policy, and ten semantic comment replacements. Source/export/member docstring coverage remains 100 percent (646/646, 4876/4876, 8819/8819 in the static census). The broader replacement title still has 4182 filler comments in 209 files, so this canonical item remains open; releasing ownership rather than claiming the entire cleanup complete."
